{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Cencori adapter provides access to 14+ AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, xAI, and more) through a unified interface with built-in security, observability, and cost tracking."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager","mode":"install"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@cencori/ai-sdk\"]],\"vue\":[[\"@cencori/ai-sdk\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@cencori/ai-sdk\"]],\"svelte\":[[\"@cencori/ai-sdk\"]],\"preact\":[[\"@cencori/ai-sdk\"]],\"angular\":[[\"@cencori/ai-sdk\"]],\"vanilla\":[[\"@cencori/ai-sdk\"]],\"octane\":[[\"@cencori/ai-sdk\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"basic-usage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic Usage"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack is a subpath export; kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard maps it\n// to a flat directory lookup and does not consult the package.json exports field,\n// so the subpath cannot be resolved until kiira.config.ts adds an explicit path entry.\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\nconst adapter = cencori(\"o1\");\n\nfor await (const chunk of chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n})) {\n  if (chunk.type === \"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT\") {\n    console.log(chunk.delta);\n  }\n}","lang":"typescript","meta":"ignore"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { createCencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\nconst myCencori = createCencori({\n  apiKey: process.env.CENCORI_API_KEY!,\n  baseUrl: \"https://cencori.com\", // Optional\n});\n\nconst adapter = myCencori(\"o1\");","lang":"typescript","meta":"ignore"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"streaming","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Streaming"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\nconst adapter = cencori(\"claude-3-5-sonnet\");\n\nfor await (const chunk of chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Tell me a story\" }],\n})) {\n  if (chunk.type === \"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT\") {\n    process.stdout.write(chunk.delta);\n  } else if (chunk.type === \"RUN_FINISHED\") {\n    console.log(\"\\nDone\");\n  }\n}","lang":"typescript","meta":"ignore"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tool-calling","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tool Calling"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { chat, toolDefinition } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nconst adapter = cencori(\"o1\");\n\nconst getWeatherDef = toolDefinition({\n  name: \"getWeather\",\n  description: \"Get weather for a location\",\n  inputSchema: z.object({ location: z.string() }),\n});\n\nconst getWeather = getWeatherDef.server(async ({ location }) => {\n  // Look up the weather for `location`\n  return { temperature: 72, conditions: \"Sunny\" };\n});\n\nfor await (const chunk of chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"What's the weather in NYC?\" }],\n  tools: [getWeather],\n})) {\n  if (chunk.type === \"TOOL_CALL_START\") {\n    console.log(\"Tool call:\", chunk.toolCallName);\n  } else if (chunk.type === \"TOOL_CALL_END\") {\n    console.log(\"Tool call finished:\", chunk.toolCallId);\n  }\n}","lang":"typescript","meta":"ignore"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"multi-provider-support","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Multi-Provider Support"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Switch between providers with a single parameter:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\n// OpenAI-compatible\nconst openaiCompat = cencori(\"o1\");\n\n// Anthropic\nconst anthropic = cencori(\"claude-3-5-sonnet\");\n\n// Google\nconst google = cencori(\"gemini-2.5-flash\");\n\n// xAI\nconst grok = cencori(\"grok-3\");\n\n// DeepSeek\nconst deepseek = cencori(\"deepseek-v3.2\");","lang":"typescript","meta":"ignore"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All responses use the same unified format regardless of provider."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"supported-models","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Supported Models"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Models"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"OpenAI"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gpt-5"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gpt-4o"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gpt-4o-mini"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"o3"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"o1"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Anthropic"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"claude-opus-4"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"claude-sonnet-4"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"claude-3-5-sonnet"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Google"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gemini-3-pro"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gemini-2.5-flash"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gemini-2.0-flash"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"xAI"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"grok-4"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"grok-3"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mistral"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mistral-large"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"codestral"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"devstral"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"DeepSeek"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"deepseek-v3.2"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"deepseek-reasoner"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"+ More"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Groq, Cohere, Perplexity, Together, Qwen, OpenRouter"}]}]]},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Cencori is an external package and its catalogue changes over time. Verify the model ids above against "},{"type":"link","href":"https://cencori.com/docs","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cencori's current catalogue"}]},{"type":"text","value":" before relying on them."}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"environment-variables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Environment Variables"}]},{"type":"code","value":"CENCORI_API_KEY=csk_your_api_key_here","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"getting-an-api-key","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Getting an API Key"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Go to "},{"type":"link","href":"https://cencori.com","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cencori"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create an account and generate an API key"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add it to your environment variables"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"why-cencori","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Why Cencori?"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔒 Security"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — PII filtering, jailbreak detection, content moderation"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"📊 Observability"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Request logs, latency metrics, cost tracking"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"💰 Cost Control"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Budgets, alerts, per-route analytics"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔌 Multi-Provider"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — One API key for 14+ AI providers"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🛠️ Tool Calling"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Full support for function calling across providers"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔄 Failover"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Automatic retry and fallback to alternative providers"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"api-reference","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API Reference"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"cencori-model","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cencori(model)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Cencori adapter using environment variables."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"model"},{"type":"text","value":" - Model name (e.g., "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"gpt-4o\""},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"claude-3-5-sonnet\""},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"gemini-2.5-flash\""},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A Cencori TanStack AI adapter instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"createcencori-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createCencori(config)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a custom Cencori adapter factory."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.apiKey"},{"type":"text","value":" - Your Cencori API key"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.baseUrl?"},{"type":"text","value":" - Custom base URL (optional)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A function that creates adapter instances for specific models."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"next-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next Steps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://cencori.com","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cencori Dashboard"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — View analytics, logs, and costs"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://cencori.com/docs","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Documentation"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Complete API reference"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/cencori/cencori","children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Repository"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — SDK source code"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../chat/streaming","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Streaming Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Learn about streaming responses"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../tools/tools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tools Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Learn about tool calling"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"basic-usage","text":"Basic Usage","level":2},{"id":"configuration","text":"Configuration","level":2},{"id":"streaming","text":"Streaming","level":2},{"id":"tool-calling","text":"Tool Calling","level":2},{"id":"multi-provider-support","text":"Multi-Provider Support","level":2},{"id":"supported-models","text":"Supported Models","level":2},{"id":"environment-variables","text":"Environment Variables","level":2},{"id":"getting-an-api-key","text":"Getting an API Key","level":2},{"id":"why-cencori","text":"Why Cencori?","level":2},{"id":"api-reference","text":"API Reference","level":2},{"id":"cencori-model","text":"cencori(model)","level":3},{"id":"createcencori-config","text":"createCencori(config)","level":3},{"id":"next-steps","text":"Next Steps","level":2}]},"frameworks":["react","vue","solid","svelte","preact","angular","vanilla","octane"],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe Cencori adapter provides access to 14+ AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, xAI, and more) through a unified interface with built-in security, observability, and cost tracking.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @cencori/ai-sdk\nvue: @cencori/ai-sdk\nsolid: @cencori/ai-sdk\nsvelte: @cencori/ai-sdk\npreact: @cencori/ai-sdk\nangular: @cencori/ai-sdk\nvanilla: @cencori/ai-sdk\noctane: @cencori/ai-sdk\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack is a subpath export; kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard maps it\n// to a flat directory lookup and does not consult the package.json exports field,\n// so the subpath cannot be resolved until kiira.config.ts adds an explicit path entry.\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\nconst adapter = cencori(\"o1\");\n\nfor await (const chunk of chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n})) {\n  if (chunk.type === \"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT\") {\n    console.log(chunk.delta);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { createCencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\nconst myCencori = createCencori({\n  apiKey: process.env.CENCORI_API_KEY!,\n  baseUrl: \"https://cencori.com\", // Optional\n});\n\nconst adapter = myCencori(\"o1\");\n```\n\n## Streaming\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\nconst adapter = cencori(\"claude-3-5-sonnet\");\n\nfor await (const chunk of chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Tell me a story\" }],\n})) {\n  if (chunk.type === \"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT\") {\n    process.stdout.write(chunk.delta);\n  } else if (chunk.type === \"RUN_FINISHED\") {\n    console.log(\"\\nDone\");\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n## Tool Calling\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { chat, toolDefinition } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nconst adapter = cencori(\"o1\");\n\nconst getWeatherDef = toolDefinition({\n  name: \"getWeather\",\n  description: \"Get weather for a location\",\n  inputSchema: z.object({ location: z.string() }),\n});\n\nconst getWeather = getWeatherDef.server(async ({ location }) => {\n  // Look up the weather for `location`\n  return { temperature: 72, conditions: \"Sunny\" };\n});\n\nfor await (const chunk of chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"What's the weather in NYC?\" }],\n  tools: [getWeather],\n})) {\n  if (chunk.type === \"TOOL_CALL_START\") {\n    console.log(\"Tool call:\", chunk.toolCallName);\n  } else if (chunk.type === \"TOOL_CALL_END\") {\n    console.log(\"Tool call finished:\", chunk.toolCallId);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n## Multi-Provider Support\n\nSwitch between providers with a single parameter:\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\n// OpenAI-compatible\nconst openaiCompat = cencori(\"o1\");\n\n// Anthropic\nconst anthropic = cencori(\"claude-3-5-sonnet\");\n\n// Google\nconst google = cencori(\"gemini-2.5-flash\");\n\n// xAI\nconst grok = cencori(\"grok-3\");\n\n// DeepSeek\nconst deepseek = cencori(\"deepseek-v3.2\");\n```\n\nAll responses use the same unified format regardless of provider.\n\n## Supported Models\n\n| Provider | Models |\n|----------|--------|\n| OpenAI | `gpt-5`, `gpt-4o`, `gpt-4o-mini`, `o3`, `o1` |\n| Anthropic | `claude-opus-4`, `claude-sonnet-4`, `claude-3-5-sonnet` |\n| Google | `gemini-3-pro`, `gemini-2.5-flash`, `gemini-2.0-flash` |\n| xAI | `grok-4`, `grok-3` |\n| Mistral | `mistral-large`, `codestral`, `devstral` |\n| DeepSeek | `deepseek-v3.2`, `deepseek-reasoner` |\n| + More | Groq, Cohere, Perplexity, Together, Qwen, OpenRouter |\n\n> **Note:** Cencori is an external package and its catalogue changes over time. Verify the model ids above against [Cencori's current catalogue](https://cencori.com/docs) before relying on them.\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nCENCORI_API_KEY=csk_your_api_key_here\n```\n\n## Getting an API Key\n\n1. Go to [Cencori](https://cencori.com)\n2. Create an account and generate an API key\n3. Add it to your environment variables\n\n## Why Cencori?\n\n- **🔒 Security** — PII filtering, jailbreak detection, content moderation\n- **📊 Observability** — Request logs, latency metrics, cost tracking\n- **💰 Cost Control** — Budgets, alerts, per-route analytics\n- **🔌 Multi-Provider** — One API key for 14+ AI providers\n- **🛠️ Tool Calling** — Full support for function calling across providers\n- **🔄 Failover** — Automatic retry and fallback to alternative providers\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `cencori(model)`\n\nCreates a Cencori adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (e.g., `\"gpt-4o\"`, `\"claude-3-5-sonnet\"`, `\"gemini-2.5-flash\"`)\n\n**Returns:** A Cencori TanStack AI adapter instance.\n\n### `createCencori(config)`\n\nCreates a custom Cencori adapter factory.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `config.apiKey` - Your Cencori API key\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A function that creates adapter instances for specific models.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Cencori Dashboard](https://cencori.com) — View analytics, logs, and costs\n- [Documentation](https://cencori.com/docs) — Complete API reference\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/cencori/cencori) — SDK source code\n- [Streaming Guide](../chat/streaming) — Learn about streaming responses\n- [Tools Guide](../tools/tools) — Learn about tool calling\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Cencori\nid: cencori-adapter\norder: 3\ndescription: \"Access 14+ AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, xAI, and more) through Cencori's unified interface with built-in security, observability, and cost tracking in TanStack AI.\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - cencori\n  - multi-provider\n  - observability\n  - cost tracking\n  - security\n  - community adapter\n---\n\nThe Cencori adapter provides access to 14+ AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, xAI, and more) through a unified interface with built-in security, observability, and cost tracking.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @cencori/ai-sdk\nvue: @cencori/ai-sdk\nsolid: @cencori/ai-sdk\nsvelte: @cencori/ai-sdk\npreact: @cencori/ai-sdk\nangular: @cencori/ai-sdk\nvanilla: @cencori/ai-sdk\noctane: @cencori/ai-sdk\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack is a subpath export; kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard maps it\n// to a flat directory lookup and does not consult the package.json exports field,\n// so the subpath cannot be resolved until kiira.config.ts adds an explicit path entry.\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\nconst adapter = cencori(\"o1\");\n\nfor await (const chunk of chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n})) {\n  if (chunk.type === \"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT\") {\n    console.log(chunk.delta);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { createCencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\nconst myCencori = createCencori({\n  apiKey: process.env.CENCORI_API_KEY!,\n  baseUrl: \"https://cencori.com\", // Optional\n});\n\nconst adapter = myCencori(\"o1\");\n```\n\n## Streaming\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\nconst adapter = cencori(\"claude-3-5-sonnet\");\n\nfor await (const chunk of chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Tell me a story\" }],\n})) {\n  if (chunk.type === \"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT\") {\n    process.stdout.write(chunk.delta);\n  } else if (chunk.type === \"RUN_FINISHED\") {\n    console.log(\"\\nDone\");\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n## Tool Calling\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { chat, toolDefinition } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nconst adapter = cencori(\"o1\");\n\nconst getWeatherDef = toolDefinition({\n  name: \"getWeather\",\n  description: \"Get weather for a location\",\n  inputSchema: z.object({ location: z.string() }),\n});\n\nconst getWeather = getWeatherDef.server(async ({ location }) => {\n  // Look up the weather for `location`\n  return { temperature: 72, conditions: \"Sunny\" };\n});\n\nfor await (const chunk of chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"What's the weather in NYC?\" }],\n  tools: [getWeather],\n})) {\n  if (chunk.type === \"TOOL_CALL_START\") {\n    console.log(\"Tool call:\", chunk.toolCallName);\n  } else if (chunk.type === \"TOOL_CALL_END\") {\n    console.log(\"Tool call finished:\", chunk.toolCallId);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n## Multi-Provider Support\n\nSwitch between providers with a single parameter:\n\n```typescript ignore\n// ignore: @cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack subpath not resolvable via kiira's paths[\"*\"] wildcard.\nimport { cencori } from \"@cencori/ai-sdk/tanstack\";\n\n// OpenAI-compatible\nconst openaiCompat = cencori(\"o1\");\n\n// Anthropic\nconst anthropic = cencori(\"claude-3-5-sonnet\");\n\n// Google\nconst google = cencori(\"gemini-2.5-flash\");\n\n// xAI\nconst grok = cencori(\"grok-3\");\n\n// DeepSeek\nconst deepseek = cencori(\"deepseek-v3.2\");\n```\n\nAll responses use the same unified format regardless of provider.\n\n## Supported Models\n\n| Provider | Models |\n|----------|--------|\n| OpenAI | `gpt-5`, `gpt-4o`, `gpt-4o-mini`, `o3`, `o1` |\n| Anthropic | `claude-opus-4`, `claude-sonnet-4`, `claude-3-5-sonnet` |\n| Google | `gemini-3-pro`, `gemini-2.5-flash`, `gemini-2.0-flash` |\n| xAI | `grok-4`, `grok-3` |\n| Mistral | `mistral-large`, `codestral`, `devstral` |\n| DeepSeek | `deepseek-v3.2`, `deepseek-reasoner` |\n| + More | Groq, Cohere, Perplexity, Together, Qwen, OpenRouter |\n\n> **Note:** Cencori is an external package and its catalogue changes over time. Verify the model ids above against [Cencori's current catalogue](https://cencori.com/docs) before relying on them.\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nCENCORI_API_KEY=csk_your_api_key_here\n```\n\n## Getting an API Key\n\n1. Go to [Cencori](https://cencori.com)\n2. Create an account and generate an API key\n3. Add it to your environment variables\n\n## Why Cencori?\n\n- **🔒 Security** — PII filtering, jailbreak detection, content moderation\n- **📊 Observability** — Request logs, latency metrics, cost tracking\n- **💰 Cost Control** — Budgets, alerts, per-route analytics\n- **🔌 Multi-Provider** — One API key for 14+ AI providers\n- **🛠️ Tool Calling** — Full support for function calling across providers\n- **🔄 Failover** — Automatic retry and fallback to alternative providers\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `cencori(model)`\n\nCreates a Cencori adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (e.g., `\"gpt-4o\"`, `\"claude-3-5-sonnet\"`, `\"gemini-2.5-flash\"`)\n\n**Returns:** A Cencori TanStack AI adapter instance.\n\n### `createCencori(config)`\n\nCreates a custom Cencori adapter factory.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `config.apiKey` - Your Cencori API key\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A function that creates adapter instances for specific models.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Cencori Dashboard](https://cencori.com) — View analytics, logs, and costs\n- [Documentation](https://cencori.com/docs) — Complete API reference\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/cencori/cencori) — SDK source code\n- [Streaming Guide](../chat/streaming) — Learn about streaming responses\n- [Tools Guide](../tools/tools) — Learn about tool calling\n"}
